# GitHub Actions

- Pin third-party actions to full commit SHAs (match existing workflows).
- Use `permissions: contents: read` unless a job needs more.
- Install native deps for whisper builds: `build-essential`, `cmake`,
  `pkg-config`, `libclang-dev`.
- Do not enable `--all-features` / CUDA on `ubuntu-latest` by default.
- Generate `Cargo.lock` when missing before test/clippy/audit.
- Keep lint, test, and audit as separate workflows.
